sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Data Scientist
    participant kubectl as kubectl / API Client
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Operator as Feast Operator<br/>(controller-manager)
    participant GoHTTP as Go Feature Server<br/>HTTP :8080
    participant GoGRPC as Go Feature Server<br/>gRPC
    participant PyAPI as Python FastAPI<br/>REST :6566
    participant OnlineStore as Online Store<br/>(PostgreSQL/Redis)
    participant Registry as Registry Store<br/>(S3/GCS/File)

    Note over User, Registry: Flow 1: FeatureStore CR Reconciliation

    User->>kubectl: Create FeatureStore CR
    kubectl->>K8sAPI: POST feast.dev/v1/FeatureStore
    K8sAPI-->>Operator: Watch event (FeatureStoreReconciler)
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Create/Update Deployment
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Create/Update Service
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Create/Update ConfigMap
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Create/Update ServiceAccount
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Create/Update Roles & RoleBindings
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Create/Update HPA
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Create/Update PodDisruptionBudget
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Create/Update CronJob (materialization)
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Create/Update ServiceMonitor
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Create/Update OpenShift Route
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Update FeatureStore/status
    K8sAPI-->>Operator: Acknowledge

    Note over User, Registry: Flow 2: Online Feature Retrieval (Go HTTP)

    kubectl->>GoHTTP: POST /get-online-features<br/>JSON entity keys
    GoHTTP->>GoHTTP: Decode JSON to protobuf<br/>RepeatedValue maps
    GoHTTP->>Registry: Load feature definitions
    Registry-->>GoHTTP: Feature metadata
    GoHTTP->>OnlineStore: GetOnlineFeatures<br/>(pipelined HMGET / SQL query)
    OnlineStore-->>GoHTTP: Feature vectors + timestamps
    GoHTTP->>GoHTTP: Async feature logging<br/>(if LoggingConfig set)
    GoHTTP-->>kubectl: JSON response<br/>(features, statuses, timestamps)

    Note over User, Registry: Flow 3: Online Feature Retrieval (gRPC)

    kubectl->>GoGRPC: GetOnlineFeatures RPC<br/>protobuf request
    GoGRPC->>OnlineStore: Read from online store
    OnlineStore-->>GoGRPC: Feature vectors
    GoGRPC-->>kubectl: protobuf response

    Note over User, Registry: Flow 4: CGo Embedded Path (Python → Go)

    PyAPI->>PyAPI: Receive feature request
    PyAPI->>GoHTTP: CGo call via Arrow C Data Interface<br/>Zero-copy record batches
    GoHTTP->>OnlineStore: GetOnlineFeatures
    OnlineStore-->>GoHTTP: Feature data
    GoHTTP-->>PyAPI: Arrow record batches (zero-copy)
    PyAPI-->>kubectl: JSON response

    Note over User, Registry: Flow 5: Python Registry REST API

    kubectl->>PyAPI: GET /feature_views<br/>REST :6566
    PyAPI->>Registry: List feature views
    Registry-->>PyAPI: Feature view metadata
    PyAPI-->>kubectl: JSON response

    kubectl->>PyAPI: POST /materialize<br/>REST :6566
    PyAPI->>OnlineStore: Materialize features<br/>from offline to online store
    OnlineStore-->>PyAPI: Materialization result
    PyAPI-->>kubectl: JSON response
